WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.500
Fundraising software
that doesn't

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.167
live in your
Salesforce org.

3
00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:07.567
It lives somewhere else.

4
00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:11.033
Your donation platform
holds the donors.

5
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.200
Salesforce gets a
copy overnight.

6
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.933
The two never quite agree.

7
00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:18.333
Pledgivo removes
the second system.

8
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:18.900
One org.

9
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.533
One copy of the truth.

10
00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:24.833
A public donation form,
backed by Stripe.

11
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.567
The card is tokenised
in the browser; the

12
00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.000
gift lands as a
standard Opportunity.

13
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.367
Salesforce owns the
schedule and charges

14
00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:36.100
the saved card itself
— not a subscription

15
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.700
living in another system.

16
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.900
Every appeal is a
standard Salesforce

17
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.333
Campaign — no parallel
object — themed

18
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.000
by a page design you
compose from blocks.

19
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.033
Ticketed events
with tiered pricing

20
00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.967
and real capacity,
on the same

21
00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:52.833
pipeline as every
other gift.

22
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.700
Donors manage
their own giving.

23
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.433
A code in their inbox — no

24
00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.467
account, no
password to reset.

25
00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.267
Branded receipts
from Settings.

26
00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.967
Refund from the
Opportunity or from Stripe

27
00:01:05.967 --> 00:01:08.667
— an hourly reconciler
keeps both in step.

28
00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.400
And it travels.

29
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.467
Two lines of
HTML put a live

30
00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.633
campaign on any
site you own.

31
00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:19.600
A managed package
on the current API.

32
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.767
No public webhook
to secure.

33
00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:24.067
NPSP detected,
never required.

34
00:01:24.867 --> 00:01:25.567
Pledgivo.

35
00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:26.467
Coming soon.

36
00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.967
Book a demo at
cloudalgo dot com.
